      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[6].displayTexts.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: On the left side is a man with a red, luscious robe and a crown with
        a gold "0" icon on it. Your mind does not produce any sort of innate understanding
        of this person. However, the crown does remind you a little of its immense
        importance in the Religion of S. A symbol of closeness with the Hand of Spawn.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[1].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You happily greet the Priest on the left. He smiles back. It is friendly
        and kind, a departure from the atmosphere you have experienced in this place.
        "Thank you for visiting us, young one. May I share an excerpt from our Religious
        Text of S with you?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[1].displayTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: You nod enthusiastically. He opens his book and recites, "0 is not null.
        It is not none. It is empty to be full. A container cannot fill without allowing
        itself to be empty. We must learn to be 0, for it is harder to be 0 than
        infinity. Once we can accept ourselves as a vessel capable of more, then
        do we begin learning." He closes the book. "I hope you welcome our teachings
        as a 0. For we are all 0's here, eager to learn. For we are yours, Spawns"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[2].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You growled angrily at the Priest on the left. Not even an intelligible
        word could be heard. Regardless, the Priest smiled warmly towards you. "I
        understand. This place can be difficult for many. These trials are just developing
        us to be better. Every version of you re-born is given another chance to
        improve. And eventually, you will satisfy the Hand of S to be freed."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[2].displayTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: You nod enthusiastically. He opens his book and recites, "0 is not null.
        It is not none. It is empty to be full. A container cannot fill without allowing
        itself to be empty. We must learn to be 0, for it is harder to be 0 than
        infinity. Once we can accept ourselves as a vessel capable of more, then
        do we begin learning." He closes the book. "I hope you welcome our teachings
        as a 0. For we are all 0's here, eager to learn. For we are yours, Spawns"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[3].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'Your mind can''t handle the pressures and stress of the labyrinth,
        and you let out a scream of terror towards the Priest on the left. Without
        a word, he embraces you in a hug. "Now, now, my son. Do not show weakness
        here. Be stronger. Hand of S will not be happy to see one of his creation
        become a failure. Endure, my child. Endure and grow." '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[4].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: A tear is shed, and a sob is let out towards the Priest on the left.
        The Priest puts a hand on your shoulder, giving you space to cry it out.
        He mutters a prayer, "Hand of S, please overlook this moment of weakness.
        I know in this young man, there is a potential to become a use for you. I
        can tell he is much stronger than his last one. Please do not kill this man.
        Let him prove himself. For we are yours, Spawns."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[5].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: Your gut tells you that the Priest on the left is a gentle and wonderful
        soul. However, your gut also tells you that not all good intentions come
        from good sources.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: UniqueResponseToPlayerDisplayTexts.Array.data[6].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: Your gut tells you that the Priest on the left is here to cure our sadness.
        To interpret the Religion of S for us. To communicate to the Hand of S for
        us. All to provide a reasoning for our suffering.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[0].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].name_
      value: Lose baby and gain 50 allegiance with priest, +1 faith
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
