      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[4].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].itemsToAdd.Array.data[0]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e744846c825aaca469c09e429ba5037e, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[0].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[0].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[1].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[0].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'The baby cries in your hands. You look to the Priest on the left side
        and with a heart full of love, you gently hand the baby to him. The priest
        smiles and gives you an approving nod. "Thank you, kind one. We will treat
        this sapling with our best care and bring him closer to the Hand of S. Perhaps
        he will become the chosen Vessel." He looks at you with warm eyes. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[0].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: He continues, "Sometimes it is the young who are the closest to the
        Faith. Religion of S often speaks of the 0. Representing emptiness, the only
        method by which openness can be born. Not letting ego or preconceived judgment
        rule over. Instead, allowing the flow of the true self to take form, growing
        alongside the Faith bestowed by the Hand of S."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[1].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[1].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You look to the Priest on the left and the crying baby in your hands.
        A sudden, instinctual fear seizes you from handing over the baby. "Not now."
        Your mind says.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[1].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: He continues, "Sometimes it is the young who are the closest to the
        Faith. Religion of S often speaks of the 0. Representing emptiness, the only
        method by which openness can be born. Not letting ego or preconceived judgment
        rule over. Instead, allowing the flow of the true self to take form, growing
        alongside the Faith bestowed by the Hand of S."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[2].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[2].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You look to the Priest on the left and the crying baby in your hands.
        A sudden rage stops you from handing over the baby. I will not let this oppressive
        Religion of S dictate this baby's future.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[3].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[3].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: 'You look to the Priest on the left and crying baby in your hands. A
        tear drops from your face. I cannot impart myself with this baby just yet,
        you tell yourself. Let me spend a few more moments with him. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[4].conditions.Array.data[0].actionConditions.Array.data[0].useStep
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[4].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: You look to the Priest on the left and show him your Coin of S. He smiles
        warmly. "Ah, a recent Follower of S," he says. "I always enjoy meeting a
        new follower, and hopefully we can take good care of you, and you, in return,
        take care of yourself and grow your faith with S."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[4].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: He hands you a thin book. "Please take this Religious Text of S., and
        when you are ready, you may hang your coin on the Roots on the ceiling of
        this room. But please come visit me whenever."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4954689198944353182, guid: 8f65fa256c4f6b043b42e10b9002b4b3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionConsequences.Array.data[4].successfulConsequences.Array.data[0].displayTexts.Array.data[2]
      value: You happily greet the Priest on the left. He smiles back. It is friendly
        and kind, a departure from the atmosphere you have experienced in this place.
        "Thank you for visiting us, young one. May I share an excerpt from our Religious
        Text of S with you?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
